WEBVTT

00:01.980 --> 00:02.020
Prologue

00:09.980 --> 00:13.820
I met a strange person on the fields when I was a kid.

00:15.830 --> 00:17.240
She kicked me.

00:17.850 --> 00:20.240
She seemed like a ridiculously huge deal,

00:20.240 --> 00:23.870
so I decided to call her "Master".

00:23.870 --> 00:26.120
I love my Master very much.

00:26.120 --> 00:27.170
Master!

00:28.280 --> 00:31.920
Master would start breathing hard whenever I hugged her.

00:31.920 --> 00:34.180
She really is kind of strange.

00:34.300 --> 00:35.190
Shiki.

00:36.770 --> 00:41.290
At this rate, you'll grow into a wonderful young man.

00:41.290 --> 00:43.940
The look in Master's eyes was pretty scary sometimes.

00:44.250 --> 00:47.490
I've brought you a present today, Shiki.

00:49.690 --> 00:52.190
Mystic Eyes Sealer!

00:55.200 --> 00:56.370
I messed up.

00:56.370 --> 00:58.050
That belongs to me.

00:58.050 --> 01:01.160
Master really is kind of strange.

01:03.080 --> 01:04.150
Well?

01:04.150 --> 01:06.860
I stole it from my sister. It's one of her finest items!

01:06.860 --> 01:09.380
My Master is a True Mage!

01:09.880 --> 01:15.330
I'm sure Akiha'll be surprised that I'm suddenly wearing glasses.

01:18.140 --> 01:18.180
We're Open

01:26.040 --> 01:27.480
Welcome!

01:27.480 --> 01:30.310
We're still open for business on a holiday.

01:31.070 --> 01:32.850
One person?

01:32.850 --> 01:35.380
Please take him to his seat.

01:36.430 --> 01:39.660
We don't normally serve newcomers...

01:39.660 --> 01:43.050
But whatever. Today's a special day.

01:43.050 --> 01:44.350
It's starting!

03:25.430 --> 03:26.680
Sorry I'm late.

03:26.680 --> 03:28.680
I just got here myself.

03:29.190 --> 03:30.560
Welcome.

03:32.080 --> 03:34.840
I've lost all memories of my previous incarnation.

03:34.840 --> 03:36.980
I'm glad you're my friend.

03:37.410 --> 03:38.400
I see.

03:42.070 --> 03:44.880
I've been feeling kind of lonely lately.

03:45.460 --> 03:50.420
Akiha doesn't care about me, and Shiki has forgotten about me.

03:52.670 --> 03:54.920
You've had too much to drink, Roa.

03:54.920 --> 03:59.210
Nero, you're such a kind person, but nobody can see that...

03:59.210 --> 04:00.210
Short skit.

04:01.290 --> 04:05.220
The next section is a story about love and money.

04:06.870 --> 04:07.710
Stop that!

04:07.710 --> 04:09.850
The wine's all gone.

04:09.850 --> 04:12.350
Love and money!

04:13.190 --> 04:13.230
Fuyuki Chicken Farm

04:16.440 --> 04:18.610
I've always wanted to see.

04:19.660 --> 04:26.100
Just how much potential is hidden within this holy cloth.

04:22.110 --> 04:24.610
Urgently

04:22.110 --> 04:24.610
Recruiting

04:28.910 --> 04:29.330
Caren-chan

04:29.330 --> 04:29.370
Radical

04:30.430 --> 04:32.750
Radical Caren-chan!

04:33.690 --> 04:36.760
Why'd you call us out so urgently, Master?

04:36.760 --> 04:40.130
My job schedule's totally packed, so I'm pretty busy.

04:40.130 --> 04:41.720
Busy?

04:41.720 --> 04:45.760
Hah, the underdog sure has gotten quite full of himself.

04:46.540 --> 04:47.200
Damn you!

04:47.200 --> 04:49.100
I can't let that pass, even if you're my Master!

04:49.100 --> 04:52.390
Stop woofing so loudly. It's disgraceful.

04:52.390 --> 04:54.310
Banknotes!

04:52.520 --> 04:52.560
Type-Moon Banknote

04:52.520 --> 04:52.560
10,000 Yen

04:54.310 --> 04:57.900
Rub your eyes clean and see, useless dogs.

04:57.900 --> 04:59.400
Banknotes?

04:59.400 --> 05:01.440
Wh-What's with that?

05:01.440 --> 05:03.170
I worked a temporary job.

05:03.760 --> 05:06.570
I sorted male and female chicks apart.

05:07.980 --> 05:12.520
The Mystic Code "Magdala's Cloth" only works on males.

05:13.380 --> 05:15.460
I didn't expect to earn this much.

05:15.460 --> 05:19.040
Uh, don't you need qualifications for that sort of job?

05:19.040 --> 05:21.340
It was basically illegal work.

05:21.340 --> 05:24.840
As your Master, I'll give you alms.

05:24.840 --> 05:26.820
Now, take it!

05:26.100 --> 05:26.140
He who has shouId give

05:26.100 --> 05:26.140
to he who has none !!

05:28.530 --> 05:31.720
I have no use for so little money, though.

05:31.720 --> 05:33.370
I don't want it either.

05:33.370 --> 05:35.730
You can spend your own money.

05:35.730 --> 05:37.350
Don't talk back at me.

05:43.480 --> 05:45.730
C-Can I...

05:45.730 --> 05:48.150
Can I hit you just one more time?

05:48.150 --> 05:49.370
Huh- Ow!

05:53.080 --> 05:54.410
This sensation...

05:54.410 --> 05:56.450
Oh no! Something's awakening inside her!

05:56.450 --> 05:59.120
Stop her! Stop our Master!

06:01.560 --> 06:02.770
Well?

06:03.390 --> 06:08.180
I was about to give them the banknotes as lodging fees, but chaos ensued.

06:10.800 --> 06:13.510
Caren, it's not like we want money-

06:13.510 --> 06:15.480
Caren! You can stay at my house!

06:15.480 --> 06:18.750
Shirou, I'd like to try some foie gras.

06:18.750 --> 06:20.250
I want caviar!

06:20.250 --> 06:23.900
Alright! Mommy'll cook you a delicious full-course meal!

06:24.090 --> 06:26.590
Staying with these people will just drive you crazy!

06:26.590 --> 06:28.120
Come with me, Caren!

06:28.830 --> 06:32.030
No! Caren-chan's my girl!

06:30.280 --> 06:32.970
Caspian Sea caviar!

06:32.030 --> 06:35.730
Shirou, I hear truffles are extremely delicious, too.

06:35.730 --> 06:39.330
The family power balance was altered.

06:39.330 --> 06:43.650
So, large sums of money can make humans sink so low...

06:46.100 --> 06:49.020
Uh oh. She's starting to resemble someone.

06:49.020 --> 06:51.030
She's always been like that.

06:51.030 --> 06:53.180
I learned something again.

06:53.180 --> 06:55.390
The world runs on money.

06:56.520 --> 06:57.660
That's exactly right!

06:57.660 --> 06:58.680
Who are you?

06:59.780 --> 07:01.930
My victory is secure.

07:01.930 --> 07:03.670
Let's look for her.

07:03.670 --> 07:05.190
Her?

07:05.490 --> 07:07.690
Please take a sample!

07:10.940 --> 07:14.330
Since these pretty ladies are handing them out, I guess I'll take one.

07:14.330 --> 07:15.950
Make it quick, Lancer.

07:16.260 --> 07:18.080
Thank you very much!

07:18.080 --> 07:19.430
Yeah.

07:25.130 --> 07:27.210
B-Bazett?!

07:27.210 --> 07:30.420
Ooh, to find you here, Bazett...

07:30.420 --> 07:32.220
I seriously didn't notice you.

07:32.530 --> 07:34.800
So that's the job you picked this time?

07:34.800 --> 07:36.140
I'm so sorry.

07:36.140 --> 07:39.220
I-I didn't choose to do this.

07:39.220 --> 07:43.730
The association's lacking both funds and manpower, so they forced me...

07:44.200 --> 07:46.440
Oh, is that so?

07:46.440 --> 07:49.630
They ask for so much but pay you so little...

07:49.630 --> 07:50.860
So not worth it.

07:50.860 --> 07:54.330
Y-Your words insult me!

07:54.330 --> 07:56.530
Every occupation has its worth!

07:56.530 --> 07:57.650
I see.

07:57.650 --> 07:57.990
But...

07:59.630 --> 08:02.910
You can't provide for your Servant that way, can you?

08:02.910 --> 08:05.150
This is what Lancer said.

08:05.150 --> 08:08.860
"I don't need anything other than money, women, and meat."

08:08.860 --> 08:09.990
I never said that!

08:09.990 --> 08:13.180
Looks like I'm more suitable to be his Master.

08:13.350 --> 08:17.180
Give me your left hand, Bazett.

08:18.040 --> 08:21.180
D-Do you think so too, Lancer?

08:27.690 --> 08:29.440
There's nothing wrong with this.

08:29.860 --> 08:32.190
It's rare to see and such a sight for sore eyes.

08:34.080 --> 08:35.790
G... Geez!

08:35.790 --> 08:37.460
You're making fun of me!

08:37.460 --> 08:38.950
Not at all! It's actually pretty good!

08:38.950 --> 08:40.540
You're such a liar!

08:40.540 --> 08:41.970
All that exposure...

08:42.570 --> 08:43.990
Stop checking me out!

08:43.990 --> 08:46.080
But you're really cute!

08:46.080 --> 08:46.710
Snap.

08:51.430 --> 08:53.200
The world runs on money, no?

08:53.200 --> 08:56.540
That doesn't apply to such a lovey-dovey ending.

08:56.540 --> 08:59.050
You just interrupted a lovers' quarrel.

09:00.460 --> 09:03.890
Please take a sample!

09:04.570 --> 09:06.680
Mmm. Mint.

09:08.280 --> 09:09.310
Manga artist.

09:09.310 --> 09:13.440
N-Next up, we have the Super United Cat Squadron: Five Ren Cats!

09:16.940 --> 09:18.700
For the cold season, you need...

09:18.700 --> 09:19.950
tangerines...

09:19.950 --> 09:21.200
...and a kotatsu.

09:21.200 --> 09:23.480
Nothing else like it!

09:23.480 --> 09:25.690
It's what winter's all about.

09:26.460 --> 09:30.610
Then you have the soft sensation of a cat at your feet.

09:30.610 --> 09:33.210
How nice! It's really winter!

09:38.840 --> 09:43.730
So you've retreated into your own territory, you little playboy.

09:45.230 --> 09:46.990
You're neither white nor black!

09:46.990 --> 09:48.730
What Ren are you?!

09:48.730 --> 09:49.860
I'm Spotty Ren.

09:54.780 --> 09:56.070
Calico Ren.

09:56.070 --> 09:57.400
Striped Ren.

09:57.400 --> 09:58.820
White Ren.

10:00.420 --> 10:01.950
All five have gathered.

10:01.950 --> 10:02.990
Five Ren Cats!

10:04.500 --> 10:06.910
What on Earth did you get into?

10:06.920 --> 10:06.960
Please watch again !

10:12.930 --> 10:14.170
Calico Ren.

10:14.170 --> 10:15.420
Calico Ren.

10:15.420 --> 10:16.920
Calico Ren.

10:16.920 --> 10:18.300
Calico Ren.

10:19.680 --> 10:21.410
All five have gathered.

10:21.410 --> 10:22.470
Five Ren Cats!

10:23.790 --> 10:25.130
Wait, wait, wait!

10:25.130 --> 10:26.430
How do we tell you apart?!

10:32.520 --> 10:33.690
Mecha Ren.

10:33.690 --> 10:35.190
Nasu Ren.

10:35.190 --> 10:37.000
Seemingly spicy but not actually spicy.

10:37.000 --> 10:38.200
Edible Ren.

10:38.200 --> 10:39.700
Sky Tree.

10:41.470 --> 10:42.940
All five have gathered.

10:42.940 --> 10:45.350
No no, you guys don't go together at all.

10:45.350 --> 10:46.070
All five have gathered-

10:46.070 --> 10:47.740
You <i>don't go together!</i>

10:57.160 --> 10:59.590
J-Just start the damn thing!

11:00.950 --> 11:02.890
Next section coming up.

11:10.060 --> 11:10.100
White Moon Princess

11:16.380 --> 11:19.320
Hey, Arcueid! Ren!

11:20.130 --> 11:21.860
You're still going to buy more?

11:21.860 --> 11:22.950
Of course!

11:22.950 --> 11:25.000
I'm nowhere near done yet!

11:25.440 --> 11:28.030
I'm Arcueid Brunestud.

11:28.030 --> 11:29.370
I'll tell you a little secret.

11:29.890 --> 11:34.710
I'm actually the Magical Girl of Justice, Phantasmoon, as a job and hobby!

11:34.710 --> 11:39.090
While my battle with the demon Akiha, the
incarnation of envy and grumpiness, is difficult,

11:39.090 --> 11:41.340
even warriors need a break sometimes.

11:41.710 --> 11:45.390
Just for today, I'll put it all aside and have lots of fun!

11:46.870 --> 11:47.510
What?

11:55.300 --> 11:59.490
I don't have a route...

11:59.490 --> 12:00.640
A trauma monster!

12:00.640 --> 12:06.950
I don't have a route!

12:03.380 --> 12:05.610
Route? What's it talking about?

12:05.880 --> 12:10.160
I don't know for sure, but it looks like her heart has been infiltrated.

12:14.530 --> 12:15.830
Phantasmoon!

12:16.100 --> 12:19.150
Don't trust over 30!

12:20.510 --> 12:22.510
Mouth and hands at the ready.

12:22.510 --> 12:24.340
A flower blooming on the face of the moon.

12:24.550 --> 12:26.030
Phantasmoon!

12:26.980 --> 12:31.670
I'll help you forget your painful memories!

12:31.670 --> 12:32.640
Here I go!

12:33.230 --> 12:36.460
Magic Circuit Fullcount!

12:36.460 --> 12:39.070
Marble Phantasm!

12:44.430 --> 12:46.360
Huh? But why?!

12:46.360 --> 12:47.990
My Marble Phantasm didn't work!

12:52.780 --> 12:54.080
Wh-Who are you?

12:54.780 --> 12:56.960
I'm Kaleido-Ruby.

12:59.300 --> 13:03.500
I'm a magical girl from another world!

13:03.970 --> 13:05.970
I'm not the only weirdo around!

13:05.970 --> 13:08.350
Could you not call me a weirdo?

13:08.760 --> 13:11.790
That monster escaped from the world I'm from!

13:11.790 --> 13:14.100
Phantasmoon, let's fight together!

13:15.080 --> 13:16.600
I guess I could...

13:16.600 --> 13:18.300
No motivation at all...

13:18.300 --> 13:20.860
But isn't that thing <i>your enemy?</i>

13:20.860 --> 13:22.380
It's none of my business.

13:26.990 --> 13:28.770
Let's fight together!

13:29.560 --> 13:30.640
Okay?!

13:31.070 --> 13:32.110
Fine...

13:34.280 --> 13:38.000
The Enforcer of Love and Justice, Kaleido-Ruby...

13:38.000 --> 13:41.000
And the White Moon Princess, Phantasmoon...

13:41.000 --> 13:42.330
...combine powers!

13:42.330 --> 13:44.390
Marble Phantasm!

14:05.430 --> 14:06.400
Please!

14:06.400 --> 14:08.030
Stop this chain of sadness!

14:14.030 --> 14:17.500
My heart and body hurt so much...

14:22.870 --> 14:25.620
I don't need a route of my own.

14:25.620 --> 14:28.840
Because everyone already loves me.

14:29.480 --> 14:30.830
Thank you!

14:39.550 --> 14:42.160
Farewell, Holy Grail monster.

14:42.610 --> 14:45.110
This was a tragedy caused by changing the game material.

14:45.110 --> 14:47.820
So what if you make it sound like a good end?

14:47.820 --> 14:49.950
Wasn't it you who let that thing escape?

14:49.950 --> 14:53.850
We'll meet again, Magical Girl Phantasmoon.

14:53.850 --> 14:54.970
Ignoring what I said?

14:55.700 --> 14:57.020
Kaleido-Ruby...

14:57.020 --> 14:58.960
Just who could she be?

15:00.160 --> 15:01.920
I didn't get to show up.

15:08.380 --> 15:10.100
I-I-I'm so moved!

15:10.100 --> 15:11.510
Right...

15:11.510 --> 15:12.850
F-F-Fools!

15:12.850 --> 15:17.540
I-I'm just so moved by all that love on the cinema screen!

15:17.540 --> 15:19.360
Wh-Wh-Who cares about the plot?!

15:19.360 --> 15:21.460
This guy's so much trouble.

15:21.460 --> 15:23.270
Next section coming up.

15:23.270 --> 15:24.270
Short skit.

15:24.270 --> 15:27.280
It's NRVNQSR

15:27.830 --> 15:29.460
I'd like a receipt.

15:30.500 --> 15:33.280
My name is Nrvnqsr Chaos.

15:33.570 --> 15:35.870
How do you spell that?

15:36.510 --> 15:37.630
Uh...

15:41.250 --> 15:42.750
This will do.

15:42.750 --> 15:44.330
Okay.

15:44.330 --> 15:45.340
Short skit.

15:45.340 --> 15:48.340
It's a Challenge

15:51.640 --> 15:53.490
A dog howling?

15:53.490 --> 15:55.020
So noisy.

15:56.730 --> 15:58.540
I'll go check it out.

16:01.230 --> 16:02.490
Hisui, right here!

16:02.490 --> 16:04.460
Yell into the 2P controller mike!

16:06.220 --> 16:09.570
Aren't retro-games fun once in a while, Hisui-chan?

16:10.630 --> 16:11.930
Back to sleep.

16:11.930 --> 16:12.950
Short skit.

16:15.450 --> 16:18.380
Man, we worked hard again today.

16:19.140 --> 16:22.550
Do we get compensation for working on a holiday?

16:22.550 --> 16:25.550
With the economy this bad, obviously not.

16:25.920 --> 16:26.950
I suppose so.

16:26.950 --> 16:28.610
Huh? No?!

16:29.130 --> 16:30.510
What's wrong?

16:30.510 --> 16:33.010
But I want money!

16:33.870 --> 16:37.030
Go sort male and female chicks apart, then.

16:37.410 --> 16:38.680
Money.

16:38.680 --> 16:40.260
Money!

16:40.260 --> 16:42.020
Money...

16:42.020 --> 16:43.800
Well then...

16:42.020 --> 16:42.150
We're Open

16:44.230 --> 16:45.760
We'll work hard again tomorrow.

16:45.760 --> 16:48.930
I want money!

16:51.190 --> 16:54.150
Would you like to continue to the next episode preview?

16:51.190 --> 16:53.150
1. Yes

16:51.190 --> 16:54.150
2. No

16:54.200 --> 17:00.830
Next
Episode Preview?!

16:54.530 --> 16:58.830
Real Thing

16:54.580 --> 16:56.480
We're doing this for some reason!

16:56.410 --> 16:58.830
Next Episode

16:56.480 --> 16:58.500
Next episode preview!

16:59.040 --> 17:00.560
'Sup, everyone!

17:00.560 --> 17:02.000
Hard disk crash!

17:02.000 --> 17:02.950
Work goes boom!

17:02.950 --> 17:04.220
Instructor!

17:04.220 --> 17:06.020
Don't do such ominous things!

17:06.020 --> 17:07.370
It wasn't on purpose.

17:07.370 --> 17:09.020
Please forgive me!

17:09.020 --> 17:11.100
Everyone, it's been so long!

17:11.100 --> 17:11.840
That's so old...

17:11.840 --> 17:14.390
It's Taiga Dojo: Spinoff Edition!

17:14.790 --> 17:17.720
So you just popped out even though we don't need a preview?

17:17.720 --> 17:19.890
Idiot! This is the real deal!

17:19.890 --> 17:22.180
You're the only one who thinks that, Instructor.

17:22.180 --> 17:26.770
You'll find plenty of me, the Tiger of Fuyuki, in this too, so be sure to support us!

17:22.180 --> 17:27.770
On sale with great acclaim !

17:26.770 --> 17:27.770
You take every opportunity...

17:28.040 --> 17:32.630
With that said, everyone, please do buy it if you'd like!

17:38.280 --> 17:42.330
See

17:38.280 --> 17:42.330
You

17:38.280 --> 17:42.330
Again

17:38.830 --> 17:40.590
See you again.

17:40.590 --> 17:42.330
It wasn't on purpose.

17:42.330 --> 17:42.370
End

19:17.030 --> 19:18.420
When it all ended,

19:19.290 --> 19:23.180
I met a familiar person on the fields at night.

19:23.830 --> 19:24.970
Master.

19:25.730 --> 19:27.390
She kicked me, of course.

19:28.190 --> 19:30.160
I had a feeling I'd meet you.

19:30.160 --> 19:31.980
It's been so long, Master.

19:31.980 --> 19:32.850
Yes.

19:32.850 --> 19:34.980
You've really grown, Shiki.

19:34.980 --> 19:35.730
Yes.

19:35.730 --> 19:37.360
You haven't changed a bit, Master.

19:38.510 --> 19:44.660
I'll take this chance to say something
I wasn't able to say when I was young.

19:44.910 --> 19:46.030
Thank you.

19:46.760 --> 19:48.680
I'm glad I met you, Master.

19:49.110 --> 19:52.600
And... is it really okay for you to nosebleed that much?

19:52.600 --> 19:53.120
S...

19:53.120 --> 19:54.630
Success...

19:55.500 --> 19:58.610
Plan "Boy H" was a huge success!

19:58.610 --> 19:59.780
"Boy H"?

19:59.780 --> 20:01.040
Huge success!

20:01.730 --> 20:04.350
By "H" I mean Hikaru Genji, of course!

20:01.730 --> 20:04.350
TL Note: The "Hikaru Genji Plan" involves raising a child to become one's ideal spouse.

20:04.350 --> 20:08.660
Master just might be the sixth heroine.

20:09.260 --> 20:15.150
Things just might get messy if she
appeared in fandisks and fighting games.
